1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
What are agentic payments?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
An AI agent pays for something on its own:
API credits, supplies, travel. No human clicks "buy."

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
So who stops it from overspending?

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Pink Agentic AI Payments checks every payment an agent
requests against your rules before it executes.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,000
$420 supplies: ALLOWED. $890: ASK A PERSON
(Luis Ortega, Store manager). $60 gift cards: BLOCKED.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The agent never holds your payment key. It gets a
single-use credential locked to one payee and amount.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Free sandbox, test money: pinkwallet.com/agentic
Sandbox. Test money. Production by early access.
